{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜1號袁絲珩（Brenice）勇奪冠軍！袁絲珩報稱是主題樂園演員，香港浸會大學傳理學學士畢業。袁絲珩多才多藝是一名斜槓族，袁絲珩擁有豐富幕前經驗，曾擔任活動司儀、舞台劇演員及網店模特兒。 袁絲珩同時是選美常客，曾在吉隆坡參加《世界華人美后2026》，並獲得季軍。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ffabef0a-393d-476d-a2a0-dec4e446636a.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026000G4MfzjD1788102298.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ffabef0a-393d-476d-a2a0-dec4e446636a.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"84894437-4c4f-42b4-9877-8ab68f74.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026NsIM7nvlIt1788102220.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"84894437-4c4f-42b4-9877-8ab68f74.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T15:19:09.896323+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}